      "narration": {
        "id": "cob.river_of_blood.intro",
        "name": "Intro",
        "lang": [
          "dv"
        ]
      },
      "text": "\"Whatever you have to do to stop her, to stop that thing,\" Christopher says to you as you prepare to set out in search of Julia. \"Just do it.\"\nYou spend the night searching frantically through the Waterfront District, but are unable to locate anything conclusive. You retire for a restless night, and hope to have better luck in the morning."
